{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_07_title", "source_sha256": "9215a3a0b38cdf915a31b15ac7336329e962c368b65b61838a4ca60ae8af3f87", "ja": "乙女たちの願い", "zh": "少女们的心愿", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "468419d824e917ecb6ed7d91d25547406fc915563db58ad0ae901b068a51bb61", "ja": "天体公演が終わり、ウィルゴの3人とプラネ\nタリウムへ。流れ星に願いをかける3人は、\nプロデューサーに「トップアイドルになった\nら、月へ連れていってほしい」と約束する。", "zh": "天体公演结束，制作人和『处女座』的三人\n一起前往天象馆。她们三人向流星许下愿望，\n并和制作人约好「将来成为顶尖偶像时，\n要带她们登陆月球」。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_07_1000_p", "source_sha256": "71ad4d414c6503caf973ecb33d33a90aad2454d0da1af3c2d4626057107060ac", "ja": "（ウィルゴの天体公演が終わり、今日はみんなで\nプラネタリウムに来た。綺麗な夜空が広がっている）", "zh": "（『处女座』的天体公演落幕，今天和大家\n一起来到了天象馆。眼前的夜空美不胜收。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_07_1001_047sub", "source_sha256": "32f1578603fb471cef1d1dd22f59d504b9d701bdce250e8895e41d56d1109a64", "ja": "すっげえ……本物の夜空みたい。\nキレイだなぁ……。", "zh": "好厉害……就跟真的夜空一样，\n好美呀……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_07_1002_015siz", "source_sha256": "1d2c533ff900afbf47c580266a33735cc101c328a66fbe74875583cd3236aaaf", "ja": "私たちの頭の上には、いつもこんなに\nたくさんの星が輝いてるんですね。", "zh": "原来我们的头上，一直都有\n这么多颗星星在闪闪发光啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_07_1003_026yur", "source_sha256": "ff898d038757699dc2371128008a935c82159c18086d56d61a16f01a669fd4bb", "ja": "星も、月も、クッキリ見えますね。星座が浮かび\n上がってくるみたいで、今すぐ物語が始まりそう……。", "zh": "不管是星星还是月亮，都看得好清楚呢。感觉星座的\n轮廓变得越来越明显，仿佛马上就要写下新的故事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_07_1004_p", "source_sha256": "f96440332e6708d3aee2494955416bcd8d82def3fac705759243127aa6c32e39", "ja": "（そうやってうっとりと空を見上げるみんなも、\n綺麗だと思うけど……なんて言ったら、キザすぎるな）", "zh": "（我觉得大家如此陶醉地仰望天空，\n也不失为一幅美景……但说出来就太做作了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_07_1005_047sub", "source_sha256": "1a9344a866b68482a899dcbc2d2f545464b16a2cd38d6ed5230c08aeb8fced8b", "ja": "あ、流れ星だ！　願い事しよっ！", "zh": "啊，有流星！赶快许愿！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_07_1006_047sub", "source_sha256": "cb1950de7bfcc511935898c1aa878d99d50c09b8cce8e87d8fcee425942178a3", "ja": "トップアイドルになれますように、\nトップアイドルになれますように、トップ……。", "zh": "我想成为顶尖偶像、\n我想成为顶尖偶像、我想成为……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_07_1007_026yur", "source_sha256": "6331b67de50bc2ca87dd27d38df9e211aa8ea2f11128e464226211643ae2b41c", "ja": "昴さん。口に出したら、\n願い事が、無効になっちゃうんじゃ……？", "zh": "昴，如果把愿望说出来，\n不就不会成真了吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_07_1008_047sub", "source_sha256": "5341dc4180d49e1eabe3007f36874111a50255a56bd1715a587fe3a7f0d97804", "ja": "あっ、いっけね！　百合子、静香、今のナシ！\nオレの願い事は、ヒミツー♪", "zh": "啊，糟糕！百合子、静香，刚才那个不算！\n我的愿望是秘密──♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_07_1009_015siz", "source_sha256": "ca1929f5e57ccce930a8146fdcfa058ff7718c0966da387ce6806a7ee96cd6b5", "ja": "ふふっ。……でもさっきの願い事なら、\n私たちみんな、願ってたんじゃないかな。", "zh": "呵呵……但我想我们大家\n也都许了你刚才说的那个愿望喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_07_1010_015siz", "source_sha256": "9a4c0fcfc24c531c3800e753b93354d3bc2242122ebe1c8cb7f29c1be7f92d40", "ja": "私は、他にもうひとつあるけど。", "zh": "虽然我还有另一个愿望就是了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_07_1011_047sub", "source_sha256": "485ad63abc72205cf9d1c16f4b2fb6be3f3e0332729a63fc01051c4d1acdf94e", "ja": "えっ、なに！？　静香ってば、なにお願いしたの？\nなあ静香、教えてくれよ～！", "zh": "咦，什么！？静香你许了什么愿啊？\n欸静香，你快说啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_07_1012_015siz", "source_sha256": "1ed7d7bfd5fecb052115b52c7d01180c40d921cb8cc1263bf052b79b81145553", "ja": "お、教えない！　恥ずかし……じゃなくて、\n願いが無効になっちゃうでしょ！", "zh": "我、我才不要！很难为情……不对，\n讲出来愿望就不会成真了啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_07_1013_026yur", "source_sha256": "140ebd251569fde4f533b5533111c3cfcee7d667368688cb2e37d1689444d701", "ja": "あっ、わかった！　静香ちゃん、いつかステキな\n恋ができますようにってお願いしたとか？", "zh": "啊，我知道了！静香，你是不是许愿希望\n将来可以邂逅美好的恋情？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_07_1014_015siz", "source_sha256": "ab3a86ad7a47ccc3905ec17ac796342e051344679310e9318c1acf9ce0fe7bb2", "ja": "ち、違いますーっ！　\n私は、恋なんかしてる時間ないんですからっ！", "zh": "才、才不是──！\n我哪有时间谈恋爱啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_07_1015_p", "source_sha256": "0235690407f8fea7ef21ff8de94093cd7485e477754cd3d20553bafc98f5b537", "ja": "静香、顔が真っ赤だぞ？\nそれとみんな、ちょっと声を抑えような。", "zh": "静香，你的脸很红喔。\n还有，你们要克制一下音量。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_07_1016_015siz", "source_sha256": "6ec9c94c2b5b46d368690c1a25592bb1771f95dc75a8de6fac88e8ceed096658", "ja": "そ、そう{$P$}の言うとおり！\nプラネタリウムなんだから静かにしないと。集中して！", "zh": "{$P$}说、说得对！\n这里是天象馆，要保持安静，专心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_07_1017_047sub", "source_sha256": "0cb97f8ff53c4a633a9c45473c3a5c1fa66b51552b6905c33d142e2600922650", "ja": "話そらしたなー。へへへっ！", "zh": "把话题扯开了呢～嘿嘿嘿！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_07_1018_026yur", "source_sha256": "ef47b560e2e4c73c5e9f2567ed85f05526eca37fdc4d49f0f97b27abc56211e1", "ja": "ふふっ！", "zh": "呵呵！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_07_1020_026yur", "source_sha256": "774b992d5c080cde85add83f7481db784adf91687990a1938795846ec2aac3b9", "ja": "プラネタリウム、楽しかったな～。\nプラネタリウムも、あんまり来ない場所ですよね。", "zh": "参观天象馆真开心～\n天象馆也是平常很少来的地方呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_07_1021_015siz", "source_sha256": "53110b5d1078aa7e349a48c4004d8c84ef4cd9e7eb340a6da4acf484e693dc33", "ja": "そういえば……プラネタリウムも、\nデートスポットだったかも？", "zh": "经你这么一说……\n天象馆好像也是约会景点？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_07_1022_p", "source_sha256": "2d86afbcb388c98ca4032e894dc824c3ec33375ac2c13f6636f8c63ac0350c71", "ja": "みんな、空を見てみろ。月が綺麗だぞ。\nプラネタリウムには敵わないかもしれないけど……。", "zh": "各位，抬头看看天空，月亮很美喔。\n虽说可能比不过天象馆就是了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_07_1023_047sub", "source_sha256": "e4a5e54227f16d82ef7314892acc5e90c5dca24edf86d284134d09567b0334d9", "ja": "月って、ホントにウサギが餅ついてるのかなー。\nどんなとこなんだろ？　いつか行ってみたいなー。", "zh": "真的有兔子在月亮上捣药吗～？\n那里是怎样的地方呀？真希望有一天可以去瞧瞧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_07_1024_p", "source_sha256": "3a814b958e0f9b9682c025c081ca0852053508317e645a49e64dcb029a0885c2", "ja": "ウサギはいないと思うけど……。技術が発達したら、\n今よりもっと気軽に行けるようになるかもな。", "zh": "我想应该是没有兔子啦……但等未来科技更发达时，\n或许去的成本就没有现在这么高了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_07_1025_047sub", "source_sha256": "429442da26094710789a102b7c6c632ce1b65cf21122b5d8eb97f2d1ff5ba24f", "ja": "マジ！？　{$P$}、\nそれっていつごろ？　オレも月に行ける？", "zh": "真的吗！？{$P$}，\n那会是什么时候？到时我也能去月亮吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_07_1026_p", "source_sha256": "4cb8672bd3e750bbfc65a787d5ef54bbe043efbdbec19a21536c926fd1e1c338", "ja": "どうだろうな。でも、もしかしたら\n近い未来かもしれないし……。", "zh": "我也不清楚，不过，\n也许那一天并没有那么远呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_07_1027_026yur", "source_sha256": "67301f3505d1a546b5423a890fac77b6fe0a443a120a06432010f9b8a53355b0", "ja": "私たちがトップアイドルになるのと、月に行けるように\nなるのと……どっちが早いか、競争ですね！", "zh": "究竟是我们先成为顶尖偶像，还是人人都能\n登陆月球的日子会先到……来比比看哪个快吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_07_1028_015siz", "source_sha256": "e31afd250e72523b3560f813c7df7706f8380f44d05d5523cf27ba8112e58b2f", "ja": "百合子ったら……でも、ちょっと面白いかも。\n月を相手に、負けるわけにはいかないものね。", "zh": "百合子真是的……但好像也挺有意思的。\n我们可不能输给月亮呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_07_1029_047sub", "source_sha256": "7dc3b3d166cd49e6585f4853f877ece1a9b938d39f8153c6826d1528fcc97bb0", "ja": "じゃあさ、こうしようぜ！　この中で、\n一番早くトップアイドルになったヤツが……。", "zh": "那就这样好了！我们之中，\n最快成为顶尖偶像的人……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_07_1030_047sub", "source_sha256": "b9fe37c7fa03eb4b0418cbb45c14f213659c86a0734d8a70dc2811840273f335", "ja": "ご褒美に、{$P$}に\n月に連れて行ってもらえるの！　どう！？", "zh": "可以要求{$P$}带她登陆月球\n当作奖励！这样如何！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_07_1031_p", "source_sha256": "062a4eca240f75f510db6dfdc77a90813aa0aa339e309bcbf91dcc39cb88e93e", "ja": "ええっ。", "zh": "咦咦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_07_1032_026yur", "source_sha256": "098b16a713f6605b7fbbf07baf24f8982b3ffdb47c2ffbbc5f3deee2fc80e9d4", "ja": "す、すごい特典ですね！\n負けられません……！", "zh": "好、好棒的奖励喔！\n这下我可不能输……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
